      "description": "<p>This blog is now closed, you can read more on this story <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/02/g7-release-barrels-oil-diesel-reserves-emergency\">here</a></p><p><strong>Back to France</strong>, midday figures <a href=\"https://www.lefigaro.fr/actualite-france/en-direct-blocus-des-lycees-les-autorites-espere-l-apaisement-apres-les-violences-d-une-extreme-gravite-400-etablissements-fermes-20261002\">quoted by Le Figaro</a> show that <strong>564 schools and educational establishments have been disrupted by the ongoing unrest, and some 600 people have been arrested so far today </strong>as the high school protests continue.</p><p><em>Europe environment correspondent</em></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/02/france-schools-protests-violence-ukraine-kallas-rome-pope-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
